    "description": "Engineer consent notice, version 2026-11-17 (kEngineerConsentNoticeVersion). Owner-reviewed wording: change it only together with that constant and the backend's CURRENT_NOTICE_VERSION. Paragraph 1. The Arabic text of this notice (app_ar.arb) is a draft that awaits the owner's review (O-03) before it is relied on as the notice an Arabic-speaking user agreed to."
  },
  "engineerConsentBodyIncludes": "That includes the messages you send the Engineer, the contents of files it opens in folders you granted or repositories you connected, and the output of commands it runs — which can include anything those commands print.",
