    "description": "Engineer consent notice, version 2026-11-17 (kEngineerConsentNoticeVersion). Owner-reviewed wording: change it only together with that constant and the backend's CURRENT_NOTICE_VERSION. Paragraph 3. The Arabic text of this notice (app_ar.arb) is a draft that awaits the owner's review (O-03) before it is relied on as the notice an Arabic-speaking user agreed to."
